<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R4_CLOSE_008>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R4_CLOSE_005
kind: line
round: R4
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV01
---
薇拉: 我把该汇报的汇报完，该表决的表决完...以为工作做好了，他们就会停。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_COMMON_001>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R4_CLOSE_006
kind: line
round: R4
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV01
---
薇拉: 那次他帮我挡住了。可下一次开会，同样的问题还是会落到我身上。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_COMMON_001>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R4_CLOSE_007
kind: line
round: R4
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV01
---
薇拉: 你可以劝我别在意...但那时，他们真的有权决定我还能不能留任。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_COMMON_001>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R4_CLOSE_008
kind: line
round: R4
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV01
---
薇拉: 他们不觉得这两种评价矛盾。只要当时能用来挑我的错，就会拿出来说。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_COMMON_001>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_COMMON_001
kind: line
round: R5
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV01
---
薇拉: 可我也让自己的女秘书，在门外等过很多次。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_COMMON_002>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_COMMON_002
kind: line
round: R5
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV01
---
薇拉: 有时是其他委员不让她听...有时，是我亲口让她出去的。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_COMMON_003>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_COMMON_003
kind: line
round: R5
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV01
---
薇拉: 她明明熟悉那些材料，能提出意见。我却当着别人说：“她只负责记录，不参与讨论。”
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_COMMON_004>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_COMMON_004
kind: line
round: R5
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV01
---
薇拉: ...我受不了别人不让我发言，却也这样堵过她的嘴。这一段，请记下来。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_OPTION_001__MENU>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_CLOSE_001
kind: line
round: R5
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV01
---
薇拉: 记得...她的名字，我还记得。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_CLOSE_003>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_CLOSE_002
kind: line
round: R5
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV01
---
薇拉: 想。我欠她一句明确的道歉。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_CLOSE_004>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_CLOSE_003
kind: line
round: R5
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV01
---
薇拉: 我让她在那么多文件上署名，却不让她说自己的意见。她做过什么，我都知道...我当时就是不肯让她参与。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_COMMON_001>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R5_CLOSE_004
kind: line
round: R5
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV01
---
薇拉: 也想听她告诉我，她到底有多生气，不用再顾着我的脸色，把每句话都写得那么妥当...
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_COMMON_001>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_COMMON_001
kind: line
round: R6
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
