kind: line
round: R6
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
薇拉: 刚来的时候，我只想知道，坐在镜头后面审我的人是谁。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_CLOSE_004>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_CLOSE_002
kind: line
round: R6
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
