title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_CLOSE_005
kind: line
round: R6
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
薇拉: 我受过不公，也做过伤害别人的决定。这些都留着吧...别急着替我写成好人，或者坏人。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_001>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_CLOSE_006
kind: line
round: R6
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
薇拉: 请记清楚：结束谈话，不等于我同意接下来所有处置。别替我签“本人同意”！
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_001>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_001
kind: line
round: R6
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
薇拉: ...其实我想回家。我一直一个人住，家里只有一副碗筷。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_002>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_002
kind: line
round: R6
