day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
薇拉: 以前有人上门登记，非问我户主什么时候回来。我说：“我就是户主，这就是我的房子。”
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_003>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_003
kind: line
round: R6
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
薇拉: 他还笑，以为我在开玩笑...好像一个女人，不可能自己有个家。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_004>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_004
kind: line
round: R6
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
薇拉: 后来我进了委员会，他才肯把户主那一栏改成我的名字。同一个人，非要有头衔才算数。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_005>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_005
kind: line
round: R6
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
薇拉: 现在我被关在这里，又没了职务...我怕他们连那个家，也不再认是我的。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_OPTION_004__MENU>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_006
kind: line
round: R6
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
薇拉: 想...回我自己的家。窗台缺了一小块，我每次放杯子，都习惯绕开那里。
<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_010>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_007
kind: line
round: R6
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
