<<jump former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_020>>
===

title: former-ruler__P03_D3_R6_SPECIAL_014
kind: line
round: R6
patient: former-ruler
day: 3
portrait: VV02
---
薇拉: 我以前总嫌家里太安静，吃饭也想着第二天的会...现在却很想回去坐一会儿。
